      "sourceText": "- `terrainUnderVehicle=-0.75 m`：仅当中心格没有地面样本时，假定地面在输入原点下方0.75 m，作为检查起点。若使用前提成立，应测量该原点到地面的关系；它不是底盘离地间隙，也不是直接读取的实车高度。\n- `terrainConnThre=0.5 m`：候选两片地面的高度差小于0.5 m才接上。过小可能断开正常坡，过大可能接上真实台阶或跨过缺口；不是允许爬50 cm台阶。\n- `ceilingFilteringThre=2.0 m`：连接检查中，高度相差超过2.0 m的候选可被标记排除。源码用绝对差，远低于当前地面的区域也可能命中；不是“高于雷达2 m就删”的顶棚线，也不是车顶净空。",
      "translatedText": "- `terrainUnderVehicle=-0.75 m`：Only when there is no ground sample in the center cell, assume that the ground is 0\\.75 m below the input origin, as the starting point for checking\\. If the premise holds, the relationship from that origin to the ground should be measured; it is not the chassis ground clearance, nor a directly read actual vehicle height\\.\n- `terrainConnThre=0.5 m`：The height difference between two candidate ground patches must be less than 0\\.5 m to connect them\\. If it is too small, a normal slope may be disconnected; if it is too large, a real step may be connected or a gap may be bridged; it does not mean that climbing a 50 cm step is allowed\\.\n- `ceilingFilteringThre=2.0 m`：During connection checking, candidates whose height difference exceeds 2\\.0 m may be marked as excluded\\. The source code uses absolute difference, so regions far below the current ground may also match; it is not a ceiling line that deletes anything more than 2 m above the radar, nor is it roof clearance\\.",
